{"id":217088015388976,"type":"album","name":"Seasons in the Abyss","artist":"Slayer","year":1990,"weight":12,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/12600-seasons-in-the-abyss.jpg","aoty":71,"aoty_user":84,"yt":"V_vM2nGkRkI","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/slayer/seasons-in-the-abyss","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/12600-slayer-seasons-in-the-abyss.php"},"desc":"Seasons in the Abyss is the fifth studio album by the thrash metal band Slayer. It was released in 1990 through Def American Records, and later through American Recordings after the company changed its name. It was Dave Lombardo's last studio album with Slayer, until his return in 2006 with the release of Christ Illusion. Seasons in the Abyss is Slayer's third major record label release. Seasons in the Abyss is one of few albums to be issued with a Parental Advisory label despite the virtual absence of profanity unlike other Slayer albums, though the lyrics depict violent acts. .","sputnik":4.21},"artist_ref":{"id":138789505391612,"name":"Slayer","info":{"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Hellfest2017Slayer_02.jpg?width=500"}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":255263121494129,"type":"genre","name":"Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":3474,"yt":null,"src":"musthear,rym"},{"id":31482837869539,"type":"genre","name":"Punk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2333,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":171871969725315,"type":"genre","name":"Thrash Metal","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":278,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":83793645545548,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Thrash Metal","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":7,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":90391435651867,"name":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1990","src":"charts","grp":"sputnikmusic","list_year":null,"rank":20,"year":1990,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":175315787363075,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Metal","s